Gen 14:1 , The battle of four kings against the king of Sodom and his allies;
Gen 14:12 , Lot is taken prisoner;
Gen 14:14 , Abram rescues him;
Gen 14:17 , Melchizedek blesses Abram at his return, who gives him tithes;
Gen 14:21 , The rest of the spoil, his partners having had their portions he restores to the king of Sodom.
